      "writtenOn": "2026-11-09T20:07:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "At the end of this, more information about the proprietary app and what it means for a user\u0027s privacy should be included. E.h. what is it called\u003e what details about your device does it collect? How can that (combined with other information like signing in with your Google account or app verification requests) tell Google?",
