        "id": 1000136
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-11-09T20:07:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "```suggestion\nCalyxOS doesn\u0027t include Google\u0027s Play Services. Instead, it ships with [microG](https://calyxos.org/docs/guide/microg/), an open source implementation of Play Services, which you can choose to turn on or off per profile.\nmicroG reimplements the Play Integrity API, and attestation can be enabled under microG Settings → Device attestation. We do not enable it by default. It’s worth noting that enabling this option will download a proprietary binary from Google for performing the attestation.\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 20,
        "startChar": 0,
