      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-11-09T20:07:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "```suggestion\nTo get it to work, follow these steps:\n\n1. Enable microG in CalyxOS.\n2. Enable “Answer license verification requests” in microG Settings → Play Store services.\n3. Optionally, also enable “Automatically add free apps to library’ on the same page.\n4. Enable “Device attestation” in microG settings.\n5. Log into a Google account in microG Settings.\n6. Log into Aurora Store with the same Google account.\n7. Reinstall your app again from Aurora Store.\n8. Reboot the device.\n\n```",
      "range": {
