      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-11-09T20:07:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "```suggestion\n- Root detection\n- Build type checking (CalyxOS uses “user” builds, while most other custom ROMs use “userdebug”)\n- License verification only, without Play Integreity Services\n- Checking of installation source (CalyxOS spoofs apps installed with Aurora Store as if they were installed by the Play Store)\n- Invasive checking of apps installed and their installation sources\n    - Some apps may not like that other apps are configured as accessibility services/keyboards, as it allows those apps to see the screen and take actions on behalf of the user\n```",
      "range": {
